  "problem_statement": "Add an IPv6 address helper named ipv6_addr_init, usable as ipv6_addr_init(&b, 0xff02000000000000ULL, 0x1), that initializes an IPv6 address from a prefix and an interface ID supplied as host-order integer values. The prefix becomes the high-order part of the address and the interface ID becomes the low-order part. For the call shown, the initialized address must equal the IPv6 address with bytes 0xff, 0x02, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x01.",
